  "goodToKnow": "Die Überlastung is overload or overwork: die Überlastung des Personals, des Netzes, der Gerichte. Employees in Germany can submit an Überlastungsanzeige, a written notice to the employer that they can no longer do their work properly, common among nurses. Überlastet means overloaded or overworked. From die Last (load). Plural: die Überlastungen."
